# "Concrete Jungle" — Jungle / DnB
bpm 170
swing 5
steps 32
reverb 0.2
delay 0.3

kick  "x..x....x..x..x.x..x....x..x..x."
snare "....x..+....x.......x..+....x..."
hh    "x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x."
oh    ".......x...............x........"

euclidean perc 7 32
euclidean rim 5 32

vol kick 0.9
vol snare 0.8
vol hh 0.45
vol perc 0.3
vol rim 0.25
pan perc 0.3
pan rim -0.3
dist kick 0.1

note "C1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ C1 ~ Eb1 ~ F1 ~ ~ ~ C1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ C1 ~ Eb1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"
